      "speaker_id": "lu_liao",
      "expression": "direct",
      "outfit": "midwife_physician",
      "text": "我的右手还能接生多久，不比四条巷子的产妇今晚有没有医师更重要。药引若要取别人的寿元，先把替代药、病人的时限和代班的人都说清楚。",
      "next": "lla_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "lla_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "lla_choice_alternative_medicine",
          "text": "先给你一夜护脉散和草木缓根剂预约，让你等到天亮；同时把两名学徒分到四条巷子，逐项写清能力边界。",
          "next": "lla_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "lu_liao", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "lu_liao_alternative_medicine_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "lla_choice_keep_emergency",
          "text": "让你继续守最危险的一班，但药物、换班与最迟退出时间必须由你和学徒共同确认，不能把坚持变成无限值夜。",
          "next": "lla_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "lu_liao", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "lu_liao_emergency_shift_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lla_line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "protagonist",
      "expression": "gentle",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "救急不能靠一个人把手臂熬坏。你可以拒绝取寿元的药，也可以接受有期限的支持；每项资源都标明来源、用途和下一次复核。",
      "next": "lla_effect_01"
    },
